        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Bola de Espinhos. A concha de Togepi parece estar repleta de alegria. Dizem que ele compartilha boa sorte quando é tratado com carinho. Considerado um símbolo de sorte, este Pokémon guarda felicidade dentro da concha.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Não Descoberto &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Togepi pode evoluir para Togetic no nível 6 ou superior quando sua Lealdade for +2 ou maior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Charm, Growl, Pound</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Metronome</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Life Dew, Sweet Kiss</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Yawn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Encore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Follow Me</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Bestow</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Wish</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Ancient Power</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Safeguard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Baton Pass</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Double-Edge, Last Resort</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>After You</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>After You, Attract, Baby-Doll Eyes, Calm Mind, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Draining Kiss, Dream Eater, Echoed Voice, Endeavor, Facade, Fire Blast, Flamethrower, Fling, Frustration, Grass Knot, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Voice, Last Resort, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Mystical Fire, Play Rough, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Rock Smash, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Telekinesis, Thunder Wave, Toxic, Tri Attack, Trick, Uproar, Water Pulse, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Extrasensory, Foresight, Future Sight, Lucky Chant, Mirror Move, Morning Sun, Nasty Plot, Peck, Present, Psycho Shift, Secret Power, Stored Power</p>",
